  "account": "破局书屋",
  "source_title": "人一旦看过《隐形的契约》搞钱就像开了上帝视角。#财商思维#商业思维",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 95.733991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "记住，不要做生意，要做资产生意，做的是利润越做越累，而资产做的是现金流越做越闲。老板的尽头是收支，创业的尽头是自由，要想实现财富自由，只有三条路径，要么靠人力杠杆，让一群人帮你赚钱，要么靠资本杠杆，让你的钱自动生钱，要么靠资产杠杆，让你手里的动产和不动产收租赚钱。缺少了这三样，那你只能用体力和时间来换酬劳，本质就是拿命换钱。你以后多看看这本隐形的契约，很多认知知和赚钱思维都是来源于这本书。你看这社会多奇怪，好多人不上班，但是日子过得挺好，哪来的钱呢？有些人天天上班，反而没有钱。后来看完这本书才发现，原来秘密都在这本书里，叫做隐形的契约。如果你想了解更多赚钱思路，那你熬夜要看完这本书，它就是一本赚钱秘籍。读完后惊出一身冷汗，会发现自己以前的思维认知就像被带上了枷锁。而每翻开一页，都像是打开了一扇心窗，勤劳能致不嘛？外卖小哥凌晨三四点下班也赚不到一万块，靠打工发不了财。书中教的全是互利社交的方法和商业法则，帮你打破社交误区，拆解关系核心，掌握相处方法，讲透社会运行的底层逻辑，用反向思维思考问题。这本书拿到以后，你不管送给谁，都会感谢你一辈子。年轻人现在读少走十年冤枉路，四十岁以后读可能迎来人生巅峰。所以不管你是三十岁、四十岁还是五十岁，这本隐形的契约，你一定要带回去认真看今天这本书，我放在左下角了。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00001",
      "start_ms": 70,
      "end_ms": 470,
      "text": "记住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00002",
      "start_ms": 770,
      "end_ms": 1610,
      "text": "不要做生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1730,
      "end_ms": 3110,
      "text": "要做资产生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3110,
      "end_ms": 4650,
      "text": "做的是利润越做越累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00005",
      "start_ms": 4750,
      "end_ms": 6990,
      "text": "而资产做的是现金流越做越闲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7170,
      "end_ms": 8550,
      "text": "老板的尽头是收支，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00007",
      "start_ms": 8690,
      "end_ms": 9970,
      "text": "创业的尽头是自由，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00008",
      "start_ms": 10070,
      "end_ms": 11470,
      "text": "要想实现财富自由，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00009",
      "start_ms": 11550,
      "end_ms": 12550,
      "text": "只有三条路径，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00010",
      "start_ms": 12730,
      "end_ms": 13870,
      "text": "要么靠人力杠杆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00011",
      "start_ms": 13890,
      "end_ms": 15070,
      "text": "让一群人帮你赚钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00012",
      "start_ms": 15410,
      "end_ms": 16570,
      "text": "要么靠资本杠杆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00013",
      "start_ms": 16570,
      "end_ms": 17870,
      "text": "让你的钱自动生钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00014",
      "start_ms": 18150,
      "end_ms": 19310,
      "text": "要么靠资产杠杆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00015",
      "start_ms": 19530,
      "end_ms": 22090,
      "text": "让你手里的动产和不动产收租赚钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00016",
      "start_ms": 22090,
      "end_ms": 23030,
      "text": "缺少了这三样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00017",
      "start_ms": 23190,
      "end_ms": 25290,
      "text": "那你只能用体力和时间来换酬劳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00018",
      "start_ms": 25530,
      "end_ms": 26850,
      "text": "本质就是拿命换钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00019",
      "start_ms": 27110,
      "end_ms": 29130,
      "text": "你以后多看看这本隐形的契约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00020",
      "start_ms": 29430,
      "end_ms": 32080,
      "text": "很多认知知和赚钱思维都是来源于这本书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00021",
      "start_ms": 32160,
      "end_ms": 33460,
      "text": "你看这社会多奇怪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00022",
      "start_ms": 33700,
      "end_ms": 34780,
      "text": "好多人不上班，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00023",
      "start_ms": 34880,
      "end_ms": 36220,
      "text": "但是日子过得挺好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00024",
      "start_ms": 36280,
      "end_ms": 37180,
      "text": "哪来的钱呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00025",
      "start_ms": 37320,
      "end_ms": 38580,
      "text": "有些人天天上班，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00026",
      "start_ms": 38580,
      "end_ms": 39320,
      "text": "反而没有钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00027",
      "start_ms": 39560,
      "end_ms": 41300,
      "text": "后来看完这本书才发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00028",
      "start_ms": 41540,
      "end_ms": 43280,
      "text": "原来秘密都在这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00029",
      "start_ms": 43460,
      "end_ms": 45020,
      "text": "叫做隐形的契约。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00030",
      "start_ms": 45160,
      "end_ms": 47160,
      "text": "如果你想了解更多赚钱思路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00031",
      "start_ms": 47180,
      "end_ms": 48600,
      "text": "那你熬夜要看完这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00032",
      "start_ms": 48840,
      "end_ms": 50340,
      "text": "它就是一本赚钱秘籍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00033",
      "start_ms": 50640,
      "end_ms": 52380,
      "text": "读完后惊出一身冷汗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00034",
      "start_ms": 52640,
      "end_ms": 55840,
      "text": "会发现自己以前的思维认知就像被带上了枷锁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00035",
      "start_ms": 56180,
      "end_ms": 57280,
      "text": "而每翻开一页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00036",
      "start_ms": 57420,
      "end_ms": 58960,
      "text": "都像是打开了一扇心窗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00037",
      "start_ms": 59180,
      "end_ms": 60410,
      "text": "勤劳能致不嘛？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00038",
      "start_ms": 60430,
      "end_ms": 63945,
      "text": "外卖小哥凌晨三四点下班也赚不到一万块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00039",
      "start_ms": 64300,
      "end_ms": 65520,
      "text": "靠打工发不了财。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00040",
      "start_ms": 65700,
      "end_ms": 68905,
      "text": "书中教的全是互利社交的方法和商业法则，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00041",
      "start_ms": 69280,
      "end_ms": 70635,
      "text": "帮你打破社交误区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00042",
      "start_ms": 70920,
      "end_ms": 72060,
      "text": "拆解关系核心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00043",
      "start_ms": 72220,
      "end_ms": 73425,
      "text": "掌握相处方法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00044",
      "start_ms": 73770,
      "end_ms": 75665,
      "text": "讲透社会运行的底层逻辑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00045",
      "start_ms": 75960,
      "end_ms": 77640,
      "text": "用反向思维思考问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00046",
      "start_ms": 77780,
      "end_ms": 78840,
      "text": "这本书拿到以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00047",
      "start_ms": 78880,
      "end_ms": 79840,
      "text": "你不管送给谁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00048",
      "start_ms": 80000,
      "end_ms": 81225,
      "text": "都会感谢你一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00049",
      "start_ms": 81480,
      "end_ms": 83825,
      "text": "年轻人现在读少走十年冤枉路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00050",
      "start_ms": 84110,
      "end_ms": 86605,
      "text": "四十岁以后读可能迎来人生巅峰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00051",
      "start_ms": 86940,
      "end_ms": 89925,
      "text": "所以不管你是三十岁、四十岁还是五十岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00052",
      "start_ms": 90270,
      "end_ms": 91470,
      "text": "这本隐形的契约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00053",
      "start_ms": 91630,
      "end_ms": 94480,
      "text": "你一定要带回去认真看今天这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b1d211336b0f5ebb_s00054",
      "start_ms": 94480,
      "end_ms": 95635,
      "text": "我放在左下角了。"
    }
  ],
